<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-065" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-065-appraisal-ws2589669">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　評曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0005" ref="57a_8f8_a32">薛瑩</persName>稱「<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0009" ref="z8o_i3j_zja">王蕃</persName>器量綽異，弘博多通。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0021" ref="30b_08l_rxm">樓玄</persName>清白節操，才理條暢；<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0033" ref="n40_190_783">賀邵</persName>厲志高潔，機理清要。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0045" ref="4qw_13i_jn6">韋曜</persName>篤學好古，博見群籍，有記述之才。」<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0064" ref="w67_wty_7wc">胡沖</persName>以為「<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0069" ref="30b_08l_rxm">玄</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0071" ref="n40_190_783">邵</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0073" ref="z8o_i3j_zja">蕃</persName>一時清妙，略無優劣，必不得已，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0089" ref="30b_08l_rxm">玄</persName>宜在先，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0094" ref="n40_190_783">邵</persName>當次之。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0099" ref="idb_k2n_p9s">華覈</persName>文賦之才，有過於<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0109" ref="4qw_13i_jn6">曜</persName>，而典誥不及也。」予觀<persName id="c-sanguozhi-065-appraisal:p001:m0121" ref="idb_k2n_p9s">覈</persName>數獻良規，期於自盡，庶幾忠臣矣。然此數子，處無妄之世而有名位，強死其理，得免為幸耳。</p>
</text>
